        "custom_HTML": "<section class=\"ycs-training-landing\">\n  <style>\n  .ycs-training-landing {\n    --ycs-navy: #12253f;\n    --ycs-text: #222222;\n    --ycs-muted: #666666;\n    --ycs-line: #e9e9e9;\n    --ycs-soft: #f7f7f7;\n    --ycs-pink: #ef4f78;\n    --ycs-teal: #68a9b8;\n    --ycs-max: 1280px;\n    color: var(--ycs-text);\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-training-landing *,\n  .ycs-training-landing *::before,\n  .ycs-training-landing *::after {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-training-wrap {\n    max-width: var(--ycs-max);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0 24px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-training-landing h1,\n  .ycs-training-landing h2,\n  .ycs-training-landing h3 {\n    color: var(--ycs-navy);\n    font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    line-height: 1.05;\n    margin: 0 0 18px;\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-training-landing h2 {\n    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.1rem);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-training-landing h3 {\n    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2vw, 1.7rem);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-training-landing p {\n    margin: 0 0 18px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    font-size: 1.08rem;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-eyebrow,\n  .ycs-hero-eyebrow {\n    display: inline-block;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    font-size: 0.82rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--ycs-pink);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-subtle {\n    color: var(--ycs-muted);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-section {\n    padding: 88px 0;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-section + .ycs-section {\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--ycs-line);\n  }\n\n  /* HERO */\n  .ycs-hero {\n    padding: 24px 0 44px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-hero-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.92fr) minmax(0, 1.08fr);\n    gap: 36px;\n    align-items: start;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-hero-copy {\n    max-width: 640px;\n    padding-top: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-hero-copy h1 {\n    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4.8vw, 5rem);\n    line-height: 0.98;\n    letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n    margin: 0 0 18px;\n    max-width: 780px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-hero-copy p {\n    max-width: 620px;\n    font-size: 1.05rem;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    margin: 0 0 28px;\n    color: #2d2d2d;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-hero-actions {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 14px 16px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-hero-image-wrap {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-hero-image {\n    display: block;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 860px;\n    height: auto;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n  }\n\n  /* BUTTONS */\n  .btn-secondary,\n  .btn-tool,\n  .btn-primary,\n  .ycs-btn {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    min-height: 58px;\n    padding: 0 26px;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    font-size: 0.98rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    transition: all 0.2s ease;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-hero-actions .btn-secondary,\n  .ycs-hero-actions .btn-tool {\n    min-width: 290px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-hero-actions .btn-primary {\n    flex-basis: 100%;\n    max-width: 300px;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .btn-secondary,\n  .ycs-btn-outline {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    color: var(--ycs-navy);\n    border: 2px solid var(--ycs-navy);\n  }\n\n  .btn-tool,\n  .ycs-btn-teal {\n    background: var(--ycs-teal);\n    color: #ffffff;\n    border: 2px solid var(--ycs-teal);\n  }\n\n  .btn-primary,\n  .ycs-btn-pink {\n    background: var(--ycs-pink);\n    color: #ffffff;\n    border: 2px solid var(--ycs-pink);\n  }\n\n  .btn-secondary:hover,\n  .btn-tool:hover,\n  .btn-primary:hover,\n  .ycs-btn:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-1px);\n    opacity: 0.96;\n  }\n\n  /* INTRO / 2 COL */\n  .ycs-intro {\n    background: var(--ycs-soft);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-two-col {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.08fr) minmax(0, 0.92fr);\n    gap: 48px;\n    align-items: start;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-method-steps {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 18px;\n    margin-top: 28px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-method-card {\n    padding: 24px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--ycs-line);\n    border-radius: 22px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-method-card strong {\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    color: var(--ycs-navy);\n    font-size: 1.05rem;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-feature-panel {\n    padding: 28px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--ycs-line);\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-checklist {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-checklist li {\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 28px;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-checklist li::before {\n    content: \"•\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 8px;\n    top: 0;\n    color: var(--ycs-pink);\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-note {\n    margin-top: 14px;\n    padding: 18px 20px;\n    border-left: 3px solid var(--ycs-pink);\n    background: #fcf7f9;\n    color: var(--ycs-text);\n    font-size: 0.98rem;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n\n  /* PATHS */\n  .ycs-paths {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 22px;\n    margin-top: 34px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-path-card {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    padding: 30px 28px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--ycs-line);\n    border-radius: 26px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    min-height: 100%;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-path-tag {\n    display: inline-block;\n    align-self: flex-start;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n    padding: 8px 14px;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    font-size: 0.76rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    background: #f4f4f4;\n    color: var(--ycs-navy);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-path-price {\n    margin: 10px 0 18px;\n    font-size: 1.05rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: var(--ycs-text);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-path-card .ycs-checklist {\n    margin: 6px 0 22px;\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n  }\n\n  /* TOOL SECTION */\n  .ycs-tool-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.05fr);\n    gap: 52px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-tool-shot {\n    border: 1px solid var(--ycs-line);\n    border-radius: 28px;\n    background: #fbfbfb;\n    padding: 18px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-tool-shot img {\n    display: block;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n  }\n\n  /* DIFFERENCE GRID */\n  .ycs-difference-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n    gap: 16px;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-difference-item {\n    padding: 22px 20px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--ycs-line);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-difference-item strong {\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    color: var(--ycs-navy);\n    font-size: 1rem;\n  }\n\n  /* FINAL CTA */\n  .ycs-cta-band {\n    background: var(--ycs-soft);\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-final-actions {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 14px;\n    margin-top: 26px;\n  }\n\n  /* TABLET */\n  @media (max-width: 1200px) {\n    .ycs-hero {\n      padding: 20px 0 40px;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-hero-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      gap: 28px;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-hero-copy h1 {\n      font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 5vw, 4.1rem);\n    }\n\n    .ycs-hero-actions .btn-secondary,\n    .ycs-hero-actions .btn-tool {\n      min-width: 240px;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-two-col,\n    .ycs-tool-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-paths,\n    .ycs-difference-grid,\n    .ycs-method-steps {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n  }\n\n  /* MOBILE */\n  @media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .ycs-training-wrap {\n      padding: 0 18px;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-section {\n      padding: 64px 0;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-hero {\n      padding: 8px 0 32px;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-hero-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      gap: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-hero-image-wrap {\n      order: 1;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-hero-copy {\n      order: 2;\n      padding-top: 0;\n      max-width: 100%;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-hero-copy h1 {\n      font-size: 2.35rem;\n      line-height: 1.02;\n      margin-bottom: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-hero-copy p {\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      margin-bottom: 22px;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-hero-actions,\n    .ycs-final-actions {\n      gap: 12px;\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-hero-actions .btn-secondary,\n    .ycs-hero-actions .btn-tool,\n    .ycs-hero-actions .btn-primary,\n    .ycs-btn,\n    .btn-secondary,\n    .btn-tool,\n    .btn-primary {\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 100%;\n      min-width: 100%;\n      flex-basis: 100%;\n      margin-top: 0;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-hero-image {\n      max-width: 100%;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-path-card,\n    .ycs-feature-panel,\n    .ycs-method-card,\n    .ycs-difference-item,\n    .ycs-tool-shot {\n      border-radius: 20px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n  <div class=\"ycs-training-wrap\">\n    <section class=\"ycs-hero\">\n      <div class=\"ycs-hero-grid\">\n        <div class=\"ycs-hero-copy\">\n          <span class=\"ycs-eyebrow\">Online Color Analysis Training</span>\n          <h1>Learn Color Analysis. Use the Tool. Become Certified.</h1>\n          <p>\n            Whether you want to understand color, practice it on real photos, or become a professional color analyst, there is a clear path for you.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"ycs-hero-actions\">\n  <a href=\"/products/learn-color-analysis\" class=\"btn-secondary\">Learn the Method</a>\n  <a href=\"/products/color-analysis-tool\" class=\"btn-tool\">Try the Tool</a>\n  <a href=\"/products/color-analyst-training-program\" class=\"btn-primary\">Get Certified</a>\n</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-hero-image-wrap\">\n          <img class=\"ycs-hero-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0623/6284/5408/files/color-analysis-tool-hero.png?v=1776625160\" alt=\"Your Color Style color analysis tool shown on a laptop with virtual draping controls\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"ycs-section ycs-intro\">\n    <div class=\"ycs-training-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"ycs-two-col\">\n        <div>\n          <span class=\"ycs-eyebrow\">A Modern Method</span>\n          <h2>Color analysis based on depth, undertone, and chroma</h2>\n          <p>\n            Your Color Style teaches a modern, color theory based system for identifying a person’s best colors. Instead of forcing women into broad seasonal categories, this method looks at the three elements that actually shape harmony.\n          </p>\n          <p>\n            It is designed for real women, real-life coloring, gray hair, olive skin tones, and the complexity that traditional systems often ignore.\n          </p>\n\n          <div class=\"ycs-method-steps\">\n            <div class=\"ycs-method-card\">\n              <strong>Depth</strong>\n              <p class=\"ycs-subtle\">Determine whether someone’s overall coloring is light, medium, or deep.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"ycs-method-card\">\n              <strong>Undertone</strong>\n              <p class=\"ycs-subtle\">Identify whether warm, cool, or olive color families create the most harmony.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"ycs-method-card\">\n              <strong>Chroma</strong>\n              <p class=\"ycs-subtle\">Decide whether clear or soft colors are more flattering and balanced.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <aside class=\"ycs-feature-panel\">\n          <span class=\"ycs-eyebrow\">Why Your Color Style</span>\n          <h3>A better framework for modern color analysis</h3>\n          <ul class=\"ycs-checklist\">\n            <li>Based on color theory, not outdated seasonal labels</li>\n            <li>Built for gray hair, olive undertones, and changing contrast</li>\n            <li>Simple 3-step system that is easy to learn and apply</li>\n            <li>Works beautifully for both personal style and professional use</li>\n          </ul>\n          <div class=\"ycs-note\">\n            The goal is not to assign a label. The goal is to identify the colors that create the most harmony with a person’s natural features.\n          </div>\n        </aside>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"ycs-section\">\n    <div class=\"ycs-training-wrap\">\n      <span class=\"ycs-eyebrow\">Choose Your Path</span>\n      <h2>Start where you are</h2>\n      <p class=\"ycs-subtle\" style=\"max-width:760px;\">\n        Whether you want to learn color analysis for yourself, use the tool on real photos, or build a business as a color analyst, there is a path that fits.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-paths\">\n        <article class=\"ycs-path-card\">\n          <span class=\"ycs-path-tag\">Learn It</span>\n          <h3>Learn How to Do Color Analysis</h3>\n          <p>\n            Ideal for stylists, creatives, and color lovers who want to understand how color works and how to identify best colors with confidence.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"ycs-path-price\">One-time purchase</div>\n          <ul class=\"ycs-checklist\">\n            <li>Learn the 3-step Your Color Style method</li>\n            <li>Understand depth, undertone, and chroma</li>\n            <li>See how color theory applies to real women</li>\n            <li>Great for personal style and foundational learning</li>\n          </ul>\n          <div class=\"ycs-note\">No certification. No tool access. No client workflow.</div>\n          <a class=\"ycs-btn ycs-btn-outline\" href=\"/products/learn-color-analysis\">Start Learning</a>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"ycs-path-card\">\n          <span class=\"ycs-path-tag\">Use It</span>\n          <h3>Use the Color Analysis Tool</h3>\n          <p>\n            Ideal for trained analysts, active students, and professionals who want to apply color analysis on real photos using virtual draping.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"ycs-path-price\">$87/month • 5 photo uploads</div>\n          <ul class=\"ycs-checklist\">\n            <li>Upload a photo and remove the background</li>\n            <li>Adjust brightness, temperature, and contrast</li>\n            <li>Virtually drape colors and compare results</li>\n            <li>Save and manage your analyses</li>\n          </ul>\n          <div class=\"ycs-note\">The tool helps you apply color analysis. It does not teach you how to do it.</div>\n          <a class=\"ycs-btn ycs-btn-teal\" href=\"/products/color-analysis-tool\">Try the Tool</a>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"ycs-path-card\">\n          <span class=\"ycs-path-tag\">Become It</span>\n          <h3>Become a Certified Color Analyst</h3>\n          <p>\n            Ideal for those who want to confidently analyze clients, get expert feedback, and build a professional service around color analysis.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"ycs-path-price\">$1997 or payment plan available</div>\n          <ul class=\"ycs-checklist\">\n            <li>Full training in the Your Color Style method</li>\n            <li>Access to the Color Analysis Tool</li>\n            <li>Assignments and expert feedback</li>\n            <li>Client workflow, support, and certification</li>\n          </ul>\n          <div class=\"ycs-note\">This is the complete professional path: training, tool, feedback, and certification.</div>\n          <a class=\"ycs-btn ycs-btn-pink\" href=\"/products/color-analyst-training-program\">Get Certified</a>\n\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"ycs-section\">\n    <div class=\"ycs-training-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"ycs-tool-grid\">\n        <div class=\"ycs-tool-shot\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0623/6284/5408/files/color-analysis-tool-hero.png?v=1776625160\" alt=\"Laptop view of the Your Color Style color analysis tool\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <span class=\"ycs-eyebrow\">The Tool</span>\n          <h2>The Color Analysis Tool brings the process to life</h2>\n          <p>\n            This is where color analysis becomes visual, practical, and much easier to apply. Instead of guessing, you can upload a photo, prep the image, and drape colors directly on the face.\n          </p>\n          <ul class=\"ycs-checklist\">\n            <li>Upload and prep client photos</li>\n            <li>Adjust lighting for more accurate analysis</li>\n            <li>Virtually drape colors in real time</li>\n            <li>Save your work and return to it later</li>\n          </ul>\n          <div class=\"ycs-note\">\n            Included inside certification. Also available separately for professionals who already know how to analyze color.\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"ycs-hero-actions\">\n            <a class=\"ycs-btn ycs-btn-teal\" href=\"/products/color-analysis-tool\">Explore the Tool</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"ycs-section ycs-intro\">\n    <div class=\"ycs-training-wrap\">\n      <span class=\"ycs-eyebrow\">Why It’s Different</span>\n      <h2>Your Color Style is built for real women and real-life coloring</h2>\n      <p class=\"ycs-subtle\" style=\"max-width:840px;\">\n        Most color systems stop at broad categories. Your Color Style goes further, which is why it works especially well for women with gray hair, olive skin, and features that do not fit neatly into old seasonal boxes.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-difference-grid\">\n        <div class=\"ycs-difference-item\">\n          <strong>Color Theory</strong>\n          <p class=\"ycs-subtle\">Not seasonal typing</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ycs-difference-item\">\n          <strong>Olive Friendly</strong>\n          <p class=\"ycs-subtle\">Built to account for olive skin tones</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ycs-difference-item\">\n          <strong>Gray Hair Aware</strong>\n          <p class=\"ycs-subtle\">Works beautifully as coloring changes</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ycs-difference-item\">\n          <strong>3-Step System</strong>\n          <p class=\"ycs-subtle\">Depth, undertone, and chroma</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"ycs-section ycs-cta-band\">\n    <div class=\"ycs-training-wrap\">\n      <span class=\"ycs-eyebrow\">Ready to Begin?</span>\n      <h2>Choose the path that fits you now</h2>\n      <p>\n        Want to understand color? Start learning. Want to work visually on real photos? Try the tool. Want to confidently analyze clients and get certified? Step into the full program.\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"ycs-final-actions\">\n        <a class=\"ycs-btn ycs-btn-outline\" href=\"/products/learn-color-analysis\">Start Learning</a>\n        <a class=\"ycs-btn ycs-btn-teal\" href=\"/products/color-analysis-tool\">Try the Tool</a>\n        <a class=\"ycs-btn ycs-btn-pink\" href=\"/products/color-analyst-training-program\">Get Certified</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</section>"
      }
    },
